---
import NoteFigure from './NoteFigure.astro';

const entropy = -0.9 * Math.log2(0.9) - 0.1 * Math.log2(0.1);
const entropyWidth = 292 * entropy;
---

<NoteFigure
  label="The roles of P and Q"
  title="Cross-entropy contains uncertainty and model mismatch"
  caption="The notebook's annotated P(x) and log(1/Q(x)) terms, followed by an editorial coin example: real probabilities P = (0.9, 0.1), model probabilities Q = (0.5, 0.5). All three quantities are in bits per flip."
>
  <div class="roles">
    <svg class="role-diagram" viewBox="0 0 340 184" role="img" aria-labelledby="cross-entropy-roles-title cross-entropy-roles-desc">
      <title id="cross-entropy-roles-title">Frequency from P, surprise from Q</title>
      <desc id="cross-entropy-roles-desc">Cross-entropy sums P(x) times minus log base two of Q(x). An arrow identifies P(x) as data frequency and another identifies minus log base two of Q(x) as model surprise.</desc>
      <defs><marker id="cross-entropy-role-arrow" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="6" refY="4" orient="auto"><path d="M 1 1 Q 3 4 6 4 M 1 7 Q 3 4 6 4" /></marker></defs>
      <text class="annotation" x="20" y="25">how often x occurs</text>
      <path class="note-arrow" d="M 109 33 Q 139 42 116 67" marker-end="url(#cross-entropy-role-arrow)" />
      <text class="formula" x="26" y="98">Σ</text>
      <text class="formula" x="73" y="98">P(x)</text>
      <text class="formula" x="143" y="98">×</text>
      <text class="formula" x="181" y="98">[−log₂ Q(x)]</text>
      <text class="sum-index" x="33" y="116">x</text>
      <path class="note-arrow" d="M 210 155 Q 253 145 254 111" marker-end="url(#cross-entropy-role-arrow)" />
      <text class="annotation" x="125" y="179">how surprising Q finds it</text>
    </svg>
    <div class="coin-values">
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">Outcome</th><th scope="col">P(x)</th><th scope="col">Q(x)</th><th scope="col">Surprise<br />under Q</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody><tr><th scope="row">Heads</th><td>0.9</td><td>0.5</td><td>1 bit</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Tails</th><td>0.1</td><td>0.5</td><td>1 bit</td></tr></tbody>
      </table>
      <p class="calculation">0.9 × 1 + 0.1 × 1 = <strong>1 bit</strong></p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <svg class="breakdown" viewBox="0 0 340 242" role="img" aria-labelledby="cross-entropy-breakdown-title cross-entropy-breakdown-desc">
    <title id="cross-entropy-breakdown-title">One bit of cross-entropy split into two terms</title>
    <desc id="cross-entropy-breakdown-desc">A bar of total length one bit consists of entropy 0.469 bits and KL divergence 0.531 bits. Arrows label entropy as data uncertainty and KL divergence as model mismatch.</desc>
    <defs><marker id="cross-entropy-bar-arrow" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="6" refY="4" orient="auto"><path d="M 1 1 Q 3 4 6 4 M 1 7 Q 3 4 6 4" /></marker></defs>
    <text class="total" x="170" y="31" text-anchor="middle">H(P, Q) = 1 bit</text>
    <path class="total-bracket" d="M 24 64 L 24 52 L 316 52 L 316 64" />
    <rect class="entropy-fill" x="24" y="76" width={entropyWidth} height="46" />
    <rect class="mismatch-fill" x={24 + entropyWidth} y="76" width={292 - entropyWidth} height="46" />
    <rect class="bar-outline" x="24" y="76" width="292" height="46" />
    <line class="bar-outline" x1={24 + entropyWidth} x2={24 + entropyWidth} y1="76" y2="122" />
    <text class="bar-value" x={24 + entropyWidth / 2} y="105" text-anchor="middle">0.469</text>
    <text class="bar-value" x={24 + entropyWidth + (292 - entropyWidth) / 2} y="105" text-anchor="middle">0.531</text>
    <path class="note-arrow" d="M 77 188 Q 51 157 83 134" marker-end="url(#cross-entropy-bar-arrow)" />
    <path class="note-arrow" d="M 262 188 Q 286 157 253 134" marker-end="url(#cross-entropy-bar-arrow)" />
    <text class="term" x="90" y="211" text-anchor="middle">H(P)</text>
    <text class="annotation" x="90" y="237" text-anchor="middle">data uncertainty</text>
    <text class="term" x="250" y="211" text-anchor="middle">KL(P ‖ Q)</text>
    <text class="annotation" x="250" y="237" text-anchor="middle">model mismatch</text>
  </svg>
</NoteFigure>

<style>
  .roles { display: grid; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; }
  svg { display: block; width: 100%; margin-inline: auto; }
  .role-diagram { max-width: 420px; }
  .breakdown { max-width: 440px; margin-top: 1.6rem; }
  text { fill: var(--ink); font-family: inherit; }
  .formula { font-size: 22px; }
  .sum-index { font-size: 14px; }
  .annotation { fill: var(--muted); font-size: 17px; }
  .note-arrow, marker path, .total-bracket { fill: none; stroke: var(--ink); stroke-width: 1.3; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  .coin-values { min-width: 0; }
  table { width: 100%; margin: 0; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: .83rem; }
  th, td { padding: .55rem .35rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); text-align: center; }
  th { font-weight: 500; }
  th:first-child { text-align: left; }
  thead th { color: var(--muted); font-size: .78rem; }
  .calculation { margin: .9rem 0 0; text-align: center; font-size: .9rem; }
  .calculation strong { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 500; }
  .total { font-size: 20px; }
  .entropy-fill { fill: var(--ink); fill-opacity: .06; }
  .mismatch-fill { fill: var(--accent); fill-opacity: .16; }
  .bar-outline { fill: none; stroke: var(--ink); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .bar-value { font-size: 20px; }
  .term { font-size: 19px; }
  @container (min-width: 640px) { .roles { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.4rem; } }
</style>
